  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Zest lemon to get a pinch, then slice into wedges.\n• In a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the water and lemon zest, then bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834016da756d38d6af3073f/step-aeee0f00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834016da756d38d6af3073f/step-367db910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop tomato and cucumber.\n• To the pan with couscous, add tomato, cucumber, baby spinach leaves and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Toss to combine and season to taste.\n• To a small bowl, squeeze lemon juice, then add fetta cubes and Greek-style yoghurt. Stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834016da756d38d6af3073f/step-b8962920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide zesty veggie couscous between bowls.\n• Top with haloumi.\n• Drizzle with fetta yoghurt and tear over mint to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834016da756d38d6af3073f/step-26dc4e30.jpg"
    }
  ]
